  characterName: Leila Khouri
  promptText: A long drought has killed our sheep. Ancient fog nets could gather
    water from the mountain mist, but the occupation authorities have outlawed them.
    Do I break the ban and risk arrest to feed my children?
  leftAnswer: Yes, risk the arrest; your children must eat today.
  rightAnswer: No, stay cautious; keep your family safe and seek safer channels.
